  "notes": [
    "What the Argus collector takes and how its engine reads a marker. Written by apps/api/test/sdk-contract.test.ts in argus.",
    "ingestRequest is the body of POST /ingest/events; browserCall is the body of POST /ingest/browser.",
    "The collector also refuses what these schemas cannot say: an event timed more than 30 days before its call arrives, or more than a day after; an event carrying a hashed address, principal or registration in a call whose component names no hashKeyId; and a fingerprint naming more than 64 components.",
    "markers.parsed is the engine reading each raw value as an agent sent it back: case ignored, \"-\" dropped, I and L read as 1 and O as 0."
